    <string name="app_name">Under the Mat</string>
    <string name="channel">New letters in the flat</string>

    <string name="w_sub">A week in someone else\'s flat, abroad, without leaving home.</string>
    <string name="w_note">The key is under the mat. I\'m away for a week, the flat is yours.\n\nI\'ve left notes in every corner: what to cook tonight, which film everybody here knows by heart, which record to put on, what\'s on the shelf. Read one day at a time.</string>
    <string name="w_sign">— your host</string>
    <string name="w_how">Twelve flats in twelve cities, each with its own person. A new day of notes opens every morning; the window shows the real time and weather over there. Cook, watch, listen and read — and the suitcase fills with stickers.</string>
    <string name="w_go">To the noticeboard</string>

